WEBVTT

00:04:26.208 --> 00:04:30.208
And I accept this
with a sense of duty and pride.

00:04:31.083 --> 00:04:32.833
I will not give up.

00:04:33.625 --> 00:04:37.833
And I will show up for people,
because they show up for me.

00:04:38.875 --> 00:04:41.333
Our courage is born from unity.

00:04:42.333 --> 00:04:45.208
Our solidarity is our strength.

00:04:46.667 --> 00:04:51.559
I also now understand
that being fearless is a commitment.

00:04:51.583 --> 00:04:55.226
It is a decision you make
every single day.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:57.934
It is a responsibility you take --

00:04:57.958 --> 00:05:01.184
responsibility for one another.